  <aside class="blade-panel"><p class="eyebrow">RESUMEN ESTIMADO</p><h2 class="text-xl font-bold my-3">Tu próxima salida</h2><p class="blade-actions justify-between"><span>Artículos</span><strong x-text="$store.shop.count"></strong></p><p class="blade-actions justify-between my-4"><span>Subtotal estimado</span><strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.total)"></strong></p><p class="blade-actions justify-between my-3"><span>IVA estimado (16 %)</span><strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.totals.tax)"></strong></p><p class="blade-actions justify-between my-4"><span>Total estimado</span><strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.totals.total)"></strong></p><div class="my-3 text-sm"><p>Total estimado MXN: <strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.estimateFor('MXN').total, 'MXN')"></strong></p><p>Total estimado USD: <strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.estimateFor('USD').total, 'USD')"></strong></p></div><p class="page-note">El importe final debe confirmarse en el servidor. No se envían estos importes al controlador.</p>@if($checkout)<button type="button" class="store-button primary mt-5" @click="document.getElementById('checkout-contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'}); document.getElementById('checkout-email').focus({preventScroll:true})">Continuar con mis datos</button>@else<a href="{{ route('store.checkout') }}" class="store-button primary mt-5">Preparar pre-pedido</a>@endif@guest<p class="page-note mt-3">Para comprar, <a class="underline" href="{{ route('login') }}">inicia sesión</a> o <a class="underline" href="{{ route('register') }}">crea tu cuenta</a>. No necesitas permisos de administrador.</p>@endguest</aside>
